# Testing & quality

## Unit tests (Vitest + jsdom + Testing Library)
- Render through `renderWithProviders` (`src/test/test-utils.tsx`): wraps `DoodleUIProvider theme="light"` + `SketchSeedProvider initialSeed={42}`.
- Query by role + accessible name; use `userEvent.setup()`.
- Each interactive component covers: interaction, keyboard, `animate={false}`, and `setPrefersReducedMotion(true)`.

```tsx
renderWithProviders(<Switch seed={42} label="Airplane mode" onCheckedChange={onCheckedChange} />);
const sw = screen.getByRole("switch", { name: "Airplane mode" });
await user.click(sw);
expect(sw).toHaveAttribute("aria-checked", "true");
```

- jsdom stubs (matchMedia, ResizeObserver, SVG geometry, pointer capture, `Element.animate`) live in `vitest.setup.ts` — extend there, not per test.
- SSR tests: `src/__tests__/ssr.test.tsx` uses `// @vitest-environment node` + `renderToString`; `ssr-hydrate.test.tsx` checks hydration. Add new components there when they touch seeds/theme.
- MCP: `src/mcp/__tests__/*`; CLI: `src/cli/__tests__/pm.test.ts`.
- Coverage only measures `src/components` + `src/animations`.

## Stories
- `src/stories/<Name>.stories.tsx`, `title: "Components/<Name>"`, default `args: { seed: 42, animate: false }`. Pin seeds on every rendered sketch (Chromatic).

## Gates (CI: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`)
1. `pnpm lint` + `pnpm typecheck` (library `lint` is just `tsc --noEmit`; docs uses `next lint`).
2. `pnpm --filter doodleui-react test:coverage`.
3. `build` + `size:check` (`.size-limit.json`: full ESM ≤ 175 kB gz; Button-only must stay smaller than full).
4. Chromatic (only if token set) and cross-PM smoke test (npm, pnpm, yarn classic/berry, bun) via `scripts/test-pm-consumer.mjs`.

## Definition of done
Gates above pass locally where possible; new component has story + test + docs MDX + `lib/nav.ts` entry; `build:registry` re-run; `pnpm changeset` added for any `packages/doodle-ui` change (patch/minor/major per CONTRIBUTING.md); brain files updated.
